    user_response: "For the NTA JEE Main React app, add a \'Submit\' button. When clicked, display a confirmation modal asking \'Are you sure you want to submit?\'. If confirmed, simulate test submission and navigate to a mock results page (or display a success message).\n\nAdd a \'Submit\' button to finalize the test with a confirmation modal showing summary stats: Total Attempted, Marked for Review, and Unvisited.\n\nWhen confirmed:\n1. End the timer and freeze the responses.\n2. Route to an Analytics & SLP Dashboard that calculates:\n   - Total Score (+4 / -1 scheme)\n   - Chapter-wise breakdown (Physics, Chemistry, Maths)\n   - \"Silly Mistakes\" counter (<45s spent on wrong questions)\n   - \"Time Traps\" counter (>3.5 min spent on a question)\n3. Display a 3-point automated Student Learning Plan (SLP) recommending targeted revision topics based on the lowest accuracy chapters."
    items {
      text: "For the NTA JEE Main React app, add a \'Submit\' button. When clicked, display a confirmation modal asking \'Are you sure you want to submit?\'. If confirmed, simulate test submission and navigate to a mock results page (or display a success message).\n\nAdd a \'Submit\' button to finalize the test with a confirmation modal showing summary stats: Total Attempted, Marked for Review, and Unvisited.\n\nWhen confirmed:\n1. End the timer and freeze the responses.\n2. Route to an Analytics & SLP Dashboard that calculates:\n   - Total Score (+4 / -1 scheme)\n   - Chapter-wise breakdown (Physics, Chemistry, Maths)\n   - \"Silly Mistakes\" counter (<45s spent on wrong questions)\n   - \"Time Traps\" counter (>3.5 min spent on a question)\n3. Display a 3-point automated Student Learning Plan (SLP) recommending targeted revision topics based on the lowest accuracy chapters."
