          text: "    explanation: \'Sums $> 9$ are 10, 11, 12. Outcomes: (4,6),(5,5),(6,4) [3], (5,6),(6,5) [2], (6,6) [1]. Total = 6 favorable out of 36. Probability = $6/36 = 1/6$.\',"
