        }
        lines {
          text: "    explanation: \'$f(-x) = \\\\ln(-x + \\\\sqrt{x^2+1}) = \\\\ln\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{x + \\\\sqrt{x^2+1}}\\\\right) = -\\\\ln(x + \\\\sqrt{x^2+1}) = -f(x)$. Hence it is an odd function.\',"
